# Lineage — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

The project's master index: **every campaign and session, what changed, and what it found**, in one legible
place. Append-only — never delete a row; supersede it (archived campaigns stay listed). This is the first thing
a resuming agent (or a colleague) reads. Each row's `@key` links to its knowledge-base resource.

## Campaigns

`status`: active · superseded · archived(forked) · done.  `approach`: a free tag (e.g. `cnn`, `sims`, `fit`).
A **fork** (an invalidating update — see project `CLAUDE.md`) archives the source campaign and starts a fresh
one; both appear here, with the fork noted.

