## Sessions (ad-hoc / non-campaign)

One-off exploration, debugging, or analysis with **no frozen metric** (see the campaign-vs-session rule in the
project `CLAUDE.md`). Findings are recorded at their **true rigor tier** — a session finding is NOT a verified
DISCOVERY unless it passed `verify`.

