## Version bumps within a campaign

A routine fix that does **not** invalidate prior findings (a data/metric correction that preserves rankings) is
a version bump inside its campaign — logged here as a one-line change-record, not a new campaign:

- _e.g._ `{{CAMPAIGN_1_NAME}}` · {{BUMP_EXAMPLE_DATE}} · `metric_version {{BUMP_EXAMPLE}}` · {{BUMP_EXAMPLE_REASON}}
